    <!-- =====================================================================
         Static interface text, English.

         Every string that lives inside XAML belongs here and in
         Themes/Strings.fr.xaml, with the SAME key set in both files. The
         views reference them with {DynamicResource Strings.X}, so the
         runtime language switch updates the already-loaded views without
         recreating them.

         Wording that the view models build at run time (counts, summaries,
         status lines) lives in Lumen.App.Localization.Text instead.
         ===================================================================== -->

